.git
.DS_Store
bin/
dist/
deploy/
docs/
agents/
**/*_test.go
# iCloud resolves a sync conflict by writing "<name> 2.go" next to the original. The copies are untracked,
# so git and CI stay green while the image build fails with "redeclared in this block". The *_test.go rule
# above does not cover them either ("collector_test 2.go" does not match "*_test.go").
**/* [0-9].*
# Web: dependencies are installed and dist/ is rebuilt inside the image.
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
